{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/1e37aae81dbe422678c2e9452b5d667d.poster.avif?t=1761385444\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/1e37aae81dbe422678c2e9452b5d667d.webm?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/1e37aae81dbe422678c2e9452b5d667d.mp4?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>VINCIT</strong> </i>is a fast-paced FPS that combines the speed and brutality of <i>Ultrakill</i>, the experimental element-combining systems of <i>Magicka</i>, and the stylized, over-the-top aesthetics of manga and anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/c6e2104066a9273ee3335f7145495c08.poster.avif?t=1761385444\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/c6e2104066a9273ee3335f7145495c08.webm?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/c6e2104066a9273ee3335f7145495c08.mp4?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world collapsed after humanity\u2019s reckless use of the <strong>Aether </strong>\u2014 a power that twists time and reality itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every two centuries, a wave resets progress and shatters the planet into isolated fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, one man wears a cursed mask and is hunted by all \u2014 the last hope to end the endless cycle before everything is lost forever.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Bullets don\u2019t just hit \u2014 they linger in time. Shoot, then punch them together to fuse their effects and rewrite the fight mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You don\u2019t just pick weapons \u2014 you build them. Customize what bullets each gun fires and in what order. Your loadout is a puzzle. Solving it feels like breaking the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Movement is a weapon. Wall-jump off your own bullets, cancel momentum with gun tosses, and chain impossible moves just to stay alive.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966800?t=1761385444","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/62d71df5e3047230135cb397a2ae04b607600ac8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761385444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/0d2b3b98e164540dd173706f5767717b5145d3dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761385444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/0d2b3b98e164540dd173706f5767717b5145d3dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761385444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains scenes of explicit violence and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/1e37aae81dbe422678c2e9452b5d667d.poster.avif?t=1761385444\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/1e37aae81dbe422678c2e9452b5d667d.webm?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/1e37aae81dbe422678c2e9452b5d667d.mp4?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>VINCIT</strong> </i>is a fast-paced FPS that combines the speed and brutality of <i>Ultrakill</i>, the experimental element-combining systems of <i>Magicka</i>, and the stylized, over-the-top aesthetics of manga and anime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/c6e2104066a9273ee3335f7145495c08.poster.avif?t=1761385444\" width=600 height=162 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/c6e2104066a9273ee3335f7145495c08.webm?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/extras/c6e2104066a9273ee3335f7145495c08.mp4?t=1761385444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world collapsed after humanity\u2019s reckless use of the <strong>Aether </strong>\u2014 a power that twists time and reality itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every two centuries, a wave resets progress and shatters the planet into isolated fragments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, one man wears a cursed mask and is hunted by all \u2014 the last hope to end the endless cycle before everything is lost forever.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Bullets don\u2019t just hit \u2014 they linger in time. Shoot, then punch them together to fuse their effects and rewrite the fight mid-air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 You don\u2019t just pick weapons \u2014 you build them. Customize what bullets each gun fires and in what order. Your loadout is a puzzle. Solving it feels like breaking the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Movement is a weapon. Wall-jump off your own bullets, cancel momentum with gun tosses, and chain impossible moves just to stay alive.</p>","developers":["OchPuch"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966800/545fc7c4b349915da35c3eb5651fc56f8532f6cd/header.jpg?t=1761385444","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966800/1646139576/37b87826c64b637265f81293e4afd64317cf1180/1761124166/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761125546","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966800/1646139576/37b87826c64b637265f81293e4afd64317cf1180/1761124166/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761125546","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3966800/1646139576/37b87826c64b637265f81293e4afd64317cf1180/1761124166/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761125546","id":257220925,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220925/movie480.mp4?t=1761125546","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220925/movie_max.mp4?t=1761125546"},"name":"Vincit Gameplay Prototype Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257220925/26dfeaa65056fa2364975e0c06e5f89b46fdedd0/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761125546","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220925/movie480.webm?t=1761125546","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257220925/movie_max.webm?t=1761125546"}}],"name":"VINCIT","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core 2 Duo E8400<